      "id": "SUPRA_HOLY_SACRIFICE_REFERENT",
      "block_id": "AO.SM.B055",
      "statement": "Original Le Brun 1843 OCR, printed pp.439–440, explicitly applies sanctum sacrificium, immaculatam hostiam to Melchisedech and argues from absence of crossing gestures; Gihr's original 1902 footnote 2 identifies Le Brun. Guéranger instead reads the phrase of the Eucharist. Both constructions remain historical interpretations; original page-image and release checks outstanding.",
